# EDITOR-UI-E6: a click on empty viewport space takes the keyboard (Slate SViewport). The viewport is the surface
# behind the UI views and a keyboard owner of its own (UIKeyboardUser::Owner null): a press that no view's element
# took gives it the keyboard (SettlePress, EditorUIPass), the gallery's code field loses focus, and the camera keys
# and viewport shortcuts read the keyboard only while it holds it (UIPreview::Keyboard, ViewportPanel).
# The owner is on the wire: `state` section "ui", field keyboardOwner = viewport | level | gallery.
# Scene without canvases (Desert_Sandbox: no UICanvas), so the level elects nothing and the empty point is empty.
# Layout, reference px (1280x720, computed from WidgetGallery.cpp, NOT measured - check 0_gallery first): gallery
# column x 300..980 y 60..716; code field x 1000..1260 y 100..270 (E5). Empty point 150,400: left of the column.
# Points = the viewport panel's points (E2: centre 640,360).
Проект Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/Desert_Sandbox.desce
Дано run UI "UI: Toggle the widget gallery"
Тогда-вид 0_gallery галерея по центру, справа панель «Lua» с пустым полем кода
Когда input click Viewport 1130,150
Когда input type Viewport - "local a = 1"
Тогда [log] state ui: keyboardOwner = gallery (клавиатура у галереи после клика в поле кода)
Когда input click Viewport 150,400
Когда input type Viewport - "zz"
Когда input key Viewport - T
Тогда [log] state ui: keyboardOwner = viewport (клик в пустое место вида отдал клавиатуру виду)
Тогда-вид 1_view_focus поле кода: одна строка «local a = 1» без «zz»; у поля нет синей рамки фокуса и нет каретки; остальная галерея без изменений
Тогда [log] нет assert, VUID и ошибок UI в editor.log
